{"3461090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Run, Veggies!", "steam_appid": 3461090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Plate!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Tom, Cornelius, and Cabb! — A fiery tomato with a knack for reaching high places, a clever ear of corn who launches kernels with pinpoint accuracy, and a strong, gentle cabbage with a heart of gold. Trapped in a sprawling food processing plant, this unlikely trio must combine their talents to leap, swing, and smash their way through a maze of deadly machinery, perilous platforms, and creeping threats. Teamwork is their only hope as they solve tricky puzzles, avoid unseen dangers, and face off against more than just machines — These challenges will test more than just their roots. The factory isn’t empty… and getting out won’t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can this veggie trio make it out before they’re turned into someone's next meal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Plate!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Tom, Cornelius, and Cabb! — A fiery tomato with a knack for reaching high places, a clever ear of corn who launches kernels with pinpoint accuracy, and a strong, gentle cabbage with a heart of gold. Trapped in a sprawling food processing plant, this unlikely trio must combine their talents to leap, swing, and smash their way through a maze of deadly machinery, perilous platforms, and creeping threats. Teamwork is their only hope as they solve tricky puzzles, avoid unseen dangers, and face off against more than just machines — These challenges will test more than just their roots. The factory isn’t empty… and getting out won’t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can this veggie trio make it out before they’re turned into someone's next meal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr